{"about_the_game":"Bronzebeard's Tavern is a goofy and playful restaurant manager sim where 1-8 players can work as a team with multiplayer co-op. Fulfill a number of different roles, serve a diverse range of customers and cook up delicious dwarven cuisine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8-Player Multiplayer!</h2>Work together (or try) to keep the tavern running for as long as you can with seven other dwarves in online multiplayer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers!</h2>Properly manage customer seating and orders and deliver them the correct foods to reap rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Up and Blend Delicious Food and Drink!</h2>Prepare food for the customers upon receiving orders from your teammates, being careful not to burn anything!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Menu!</h2>Your daily customers are always different! Design your menu however you like based on the day's forecast and food sales!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many Customers to Discover!</h2>There's always an unfamiliar face showing up when you're working in a tavern... can you satisfy them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your Tavern!</h2>Build up your tavern with upgrades! These decisions change the way you play and are crucial for progressing into tougher days. Opt for more customer capacity with a shiny new expansion or utilities like more blenders or more stoves to increase your output!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Trainee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/7bb47848b163036a6aaed93b167f4990ed2d0dfb.jpg"},{"name":"Chefy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/3b61b7579fc8633625546d7035f20b9f3267db3a.jpg"},{"name":"Sous Chefy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/32ed55e2b7cdd889f819a75f322096615ceb29b9.jpg"},{"name":"Technician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/75d8f81737beb6acc8a6268b3e2d13e037236b12.jpg"},{"name":"Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/6d84358ecfa220a95d70e55ac8cf0c3ed0f3716e.jpg"},{"name":"Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/5c2cd66445d2fea6e0158d4531b52813339f87e8.jpg"},{"name":"The Prince of Gluttony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/cc93ef737443dd166cb3523f0d745131a15f793b.jpg"},{"name":"The King of Dwarves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/53481c232e3f70f66454277d19ca2ac39926a88d.jpg"},{"name":"The Queen of Frost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/ca8bc6deb851a95dd98158a9ad4256d66b767226.jpg"},{"name":"Tavern Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2422870/2975bc5e0a2be056855e3b75e409182fc68fa616.jpg"}],"total":51},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2422870?t=1770975949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770975949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/b04cfe967df733e90bbcd220218cd4d685d0db56/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1770975949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/b04cfe967df733e90bbcd220218cd4d685d0db56/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1770975949","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Bronzebeard's Tavern is a goofy and playful restaurant manager sim where 1-8 players can work as a team with multiplayer co-op. Fulfill a number of different roles, serve a diverse range of customers and cook up delicious dwarven cuisine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8-Player Multiplayer!</h2>Work together (or try) to keep the tavern running for as long as you can with seven other dwarves in online multiplayer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers!</h2>Properly manage customer seating and orders and deliver them the correct foods to reap rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Up and Blend Delicious Food and Drink!</h2>Prepare food for the customers upon receiving orders from your teammates, being careful not to burn anything!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Menu!</h2>Your daily customers are always different! Design your menu however you like based on the day's forecast and food sales!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.mp4?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many Customers to Discover!</h2>There's always an unfamiliar face showing up when you're working in a tavern... can you satisfy them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.poster.avif?t=1770975949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.webm?t=1770975949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.mp